  "description": "Keane Mahony Smith are delighted to present this wonderful two bedroom duplex apartment in a fantastic location on the Clybaun Road.\n\nThis well maintained private development is situated only 5.5 km from Galway city centre and a short distance to Salthill village. The discerning purchaser will have a host of facilities and amenities on its doorstep with medical centre, shop, Tommy Sheridan’s Bar and Restaurant and a regular bus route outside the gates of the development. The Clybaun Hotel, Gateway Shopping Centre, Dunnes, Lidl, Aldi, Tesco, schools and leisure facilities are all within close proximity of no 33 Fearnog.\n\nNo 33 is a two bedroom duplex apartment with own door entrance and it is set over the first and second floors. The development is gated with secure car parking and an abundance of communal green areas.\n\nAchieving a C1 BER Rating, the property has a gas boiler and upgraded insulation.\n\nThe accommodation of approx. 91 sq. m. comprises own door entrance, hallway, kitchen, an open plan dining/ living area. The second floor comprises two double bedrooms, one ensuite and the main bathroom. There are built in wardrobes in both bedrooms.\n\nThis property would make an ideal first time buyer property or those seeking to be within walking distance of all facilities.\n\nFor investors, this property forms part of a pooled rental system with the management company Ocean Property Management.\n\nViewing is highly advised through Keane Mahony Smith.\n\nMEASUREMENTS\nFirst Floor\nEntrance Hall 2.24 x 2.28 - tiled flooring\nKitchen\t\t 2.27 x 3.56 - tiled flooring\nLiving/ Dining 6.02 x 4.65 - tiled flooring, gas fireplace \nSecond Floor\nBedroom 1\t3.33 x 4.66 - laminate flooring, built in robe\nBathroom\t2.35 x 1.75- fully tiled, w.c, wh.b, bath with shower\nBedroom 2\t3.74 x 3.55- laminate flooring, built in robe\nEnsuite\t\t0.96 x 3.74 – fully tiled, w.c., w.h.b., shower",
